 "title": "The Knight Who Came Back",
 "kind": "war",
 "seed": 4404,
 "max_tier": 4,
 "ai": "easy",
 "intro": [
  "Scouts come back from the fens with a name no one wants to say. The dead are led by a knight on a gibbet-horse, in the faded colours of House Wren. Sir Orrin Wren died a hundred years ago holding the gate shut against the Ashen Host. His great-grandson now has to cut him down.",
  "Orrin rides with gibbet knights, far stronger than anything Greyhold can raise yet (tier 4 is open: lancers). His riders come out of the drowned dikes as long as the dead hold the sluices there.",
  "Retake Fenwick Ford, open the two dike sluices, and break Saint Orrin's Rest."
 ],
