  {
   "if": {
    "flag": "orrin_told"
   },
   "text": [
    "Orrin falls in the chapel yard. Before the light leaves his eyes he grips Aldous's wrist, and for a moment he knows him. \"Edric's blood. Good.\"",
    "\"The stone is cracking, boy. They will not tell you. Go to the mountain.\""
   ]
  },
